  <name>Snipunix</name>
  <summary>Screenshot. Annotate. Share.</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Snipunix captures the screen through the desktop Screenshot portal and
      lets you choose a region from a frozen image. The M0 prototype covers
      capture, region selection, and PNG saving. Annotation and sharing arrive
      in later milestones.
    </p>
    <p>
      Images stay in memory until you save them. Snipunix does not upload
      anything and contains no telemetry.
    </p>
  </description>
